			"notes": "**2.2 Boshys BTE Utils 26.2 Release**\nUpdates since 2.1 full release:\n- Legacy saved marker files (saved from before 2.1) now show line connections in the 2.1+ line rendering system.\n- When a KML file finishes importing, players are now automatically changed back to creative mode\n- `/boshys-bt-utils updateMarkers` now also updates line connection's opacity, colour and thickness as well as markers.\n- `/boshys-bt-utils overlay tempHide` is now toggleable, similarly to how tempHide for markers is toggleable without needing to determine a boolean value.\n- You can now use `/bbu` as a short alternative for `/boshys-bt-utils`"
		},
