			"notes": "**2.1 Boshys BTE Utils 2nd 26.2 Beta Release**\nCurrently there is still a large issue with the rendering of overlays, but the following issues since the last beta release have been fixed:\n- Messages that were sent as action bars in 1.21.10 are now sent as action bars again in 26.2\n- Importing KMLs no longer kicks you from the server or world for \"Illegal Characters\" - No longer uses titles, instead uses a bossbar\n- `/boshys-bt-utils moveMarker`without any x, y, or z coordinates moves the marker selected to the position the player is standing in at that moment once again."
