			"notes": "New features since 2.0\n- Complete remake of customising markers, circles and lines (opacity, scale, colour)\n- Changed the rendering system of lines to a similar system of markers to prevent glitches when lines are too long.\n- Lines are now selectable similarly to markers and can be deleted similarly to markers.\n- Added a 30 second expiration timer to /boshys-bt-utils confirmClear.\n- Made it so that /boshys-bt-utils tempHide works as a toggle instead of having to type true or false each time.\n- Fixed the /boshys-bt-utils importMultipleKMLs subcommand issue where you have to type it twice\n- Fixed a bug where lines are connected to markers you didn't select.\n- Fixed the input box inside the overlays mod-menu page where you couldn't see what you were typing."
